# Keep the republished upstream file byte-identical to its published source.
#
# `Erdos504Formal/Erdos504.lean` is republished unchanged from
# ToshiDad/erdos-504 @ fd344a9b65ecaebca66b77497fea197cb895960e, whose git
# blob is d1add0f664ac47a4e8b4a2124f97627fff57bbda (LF line endings).  The
# stored blob of that path must stay exactly those bytes, so end-of-line
# conversion is disabled for it: with `-text` the working tree and the blob
# agree on every platform and no contributor's `core.autocrlf` setting can
# re-normalise the republished file.
#
# Check with
#
#   git cat-file blob <commit>:Erdos504Formal/Erdos504.lean | git hash-object --stdin
#
# which must print d1add0f664ac47a4e8b4a2124f97627fff57bbda, and
#
#   git hash-object --no-filters Erdos504Formal/Erdos504.lean
#
# which must print the same id.
#
# The other files in this repository are authored with LF line endings.
Erdos504Formal/Erdos504.lean -text
